      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/colombia/banco-del-norte-5-pesos-1882/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"The North Bank — Five Pesos (1882)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/free-banking/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Free Banking catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Free Banking &middot; Socorro, Santander &middot; 1882</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">The North Bank</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Five Pesos &middot; Series B &middot; Socorro, January 1.&ordm; 1882</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"colombia-banco-del-norte-5-pesos-1882\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-del-norte-5-pesos-1882.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-del-norte-5-pesos-1882.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Banknote of 5 pesos de The North Bank, obverse arriba con viñeta de dos caballos y rosetón con el numeral 5, reverse abajo con la leyenda Banco del Norte en marco de seguridad\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"580\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Colombia (Socorro, Santander)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Banco del Norte, private bank established in the province of Santander</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Five Pesos</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Paper</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Lithograph by D. Paredes, Bogotá</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Series / Date of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Series B, Socorro, January 1.&ordm;, 1882</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signatures</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The 2.&ordm; Director &middot; The Managing Director &middot; The 3.&deg; Director</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Legal Constitution</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Established by deed of September 25, 1881, N.&deg; 330, before the Notary of the Socorro Circuit</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Large private banking format from the 19th century, approx. 185 &times; 95mm</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick no.&deg; S722</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"colombia-banco-del-norte-5-pesos-1882\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-del-norte-5-pesos-1882.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-del-norte-5-pesos-1882.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of 5 pesos de The North Bank, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A bank from Santander Province:</strong>The Banco del Norte was established in Socorro, the historical capital of the province of Santander, by public deed of September 25, 1881, with its first series of banknotes issued two years later, in 1882.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1,2</sup>&mdash;one of the numerous regional private banks authorized to issue their own banknote under the free banking regime in force in Colombia between 1871 and 1886.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Printed in Bogotá:</strong>unlike banknotes from capital-city banks printed by foreign firms, this specimen came from D. Paredes’s local lithographic shop in Bogotá, using limestone plates to transfer the design to paper &mdash;a common practice among smaller regional banks; indeed, this bank’s notes were known for lacking a printer’s imprint.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">End of operations:</strong>The Banco del Norte was liquidated in 1919, a year after the death of Mainero, its main shareholder.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Upper left vignette:</strong>two wild horses running free, an uncommon iconographic motif among Colombian banknotes of the period.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Right rosette:</strong>large geometric rose window that frames the numeral &ldquo;5&rdquo;, formed by guilloches of high-density interlaced curved lines.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Main text:</strong>&ldquo;THE BANK OF THE NORTH will pay the bearer on demand FIVE PESOS.&rdquo;</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Informative margins:</strong>The left margin details the hours of operation &ldquo;from 10 in the morning to 3 in the afternoon of each non-holiday day&rdquo;; The right margin certifies the legal constitution of the bank by deed of September 25, 1881.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>ornamental frame of fine security frames, with the openwork denomination showing &ldquo;BANCO DEL NORTE&rdquo; flanked by decorative numbers &ldquo;5&rdquo;, and the central indication for the signature of &ldquo;The Cashier&rdquo;.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Color:</strong>black ink over a light-green-tinted security background on the obverse, with the reverse in pale gray tones.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <div style=\"width:100%; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. The Numismatics Bogota, collection: &ldquo;The bank was established in 1880. The first series was issued two years later&hellip; The banknotes were characterized by the lack of imprints. It was liquidated in 1919, a year after the death of its main shareholder, Mainero.&rdquo;<em>lanumismaticabogota.com</em>.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">2. Villegas Editores, &ldquo;The free banking and the issuance of currency&rdquo;,<em>100libroslibres.com</em>: &ldquo;Banco del Norte, founded in Socorro, in 1881.&rdquo;</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "The North Bank",
      "eyebrow": "Banca Libre · Socorro, Santander · 1882"
    }
